.TH ZVM-USE 1 "August 2026" "ZVM" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
zvm-use \- select the active Zig version
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B zvm use
.I version
.br
.B zvm use --sync
.SH DESCRIPTION
Select an installed Zig version and update the executables exposed through
ZVM's
.I bin
directory.
The version may be exact, shorthand, or an alias; see
.BR zvm (1).
.PP
When no version is supplied, ZVM attempts to read
.B minimum_zig_version
from
.I build.zig.zon
in the current project.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --sync
Read a
.B //! zvm-lock:
directive from
.I build.zig
in the current directory and select its version.
.SH EXAMPLES
.EX
zvm use 0.14.1
zvm use stable
zvm use --sync
.EE
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR zvm (1),
.BR zvm-install (1),
.BR zvm-list (1),
.BR zvm-alias (1)
